        "kab" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Asebter i tettaɛraḍeḍ ad t-twaliḍ ur yezmir ara ad d-yettwaskan acku asmel-a yesra tuqqna taɣelsant.\n• Ugur ad yili akked usmel-a web, ur yelli wayen ara t-tgeḍ i wakken ad yefru.\n• You can notify the website’s administrator about the problem."
