        "cak" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ri okik'amaya'l nisamäj pa rub'eyal majun okem pa k'amaya'l, ruma ri' toq man tikirel ta nok pa ri ch'akulal nik'utüx chi re.\n• ¿La okinäq ri okisab'äl pa jun tzijïl k'amab'ey?\n• Tapitz'a' “Titojtob'ëx chik” richin tiq'ax pa rub'eyal okem pa k'amaya'l chuqa' tisamajib'ëx chik ri ruxaq kamaya'l."
